thought there might be a better way than this:

temp$col <- rep("blue", 10);
temp$col[temp$groups == "B"] <- "red";
xyplot(y ~ x, temp, cex = temp$cex, pch = 19, col = temp$col);

Any suggestions/advice is much appreciated!
Paul

